PROJECT: The Universal Ledger

THERE IS A Number called "Revenue" with value 1000.
THERE IS A Number called "Cost" with value 400.
THERE IS A Number called "Profit" with value 0.
THERE IS A Number called "TaxRate" with value 0.1.

WHEN "Audit" is triggered:
  - SET "Profit" to "Revenue" MINUS "Cost".
  - SET "Tax" to "Profit" TIMES "TaxRate".
  - OUTPUT "The Net Profit is:".
  - OUTPUT "Profit".

CONSTRAINT:
  - "Cost" cannot be greater than "Revenue".
